<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-10-14T12:12:38.522Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 12:12:38 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian federal forces have moved into the strategic Tigray town of Adwa near the Eritrean border and say they now control the regional airport, while a pro-government militia also reports seizing the airport. Ethiopian drones have struck Eritrean troops that entered Ethiopian territory to support Tigrayan rebels. Social media is being used as a battleground for propaganda in the conflict. The war caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQb2FQTWlGMzdwSWxvMmdvRDNvc290Qkk2bnpjbkxIaU5UZUVrXzZPbWgzR3JuQ2dPOXkyYlk1VjhMNl8teWJ3aE41UFFLS0pnYlB1ZGEwS0lPYzJYcWRkVjZwdkw3NEgtUXFwZm5jdDd3cXVxdlZCMnEwTDNway1tZmZtMXhjWFl0RmtOTlFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPS2xYb3JZZjd5V0VSaTNTNUlIQ3haLUZjdDhXSllpU3Z6VTg0SkVIUjkwRWJNZ0o2aXZtQTNxSUdHX0VpNUFaMlphS1lkNGZ2X1I0VzVYNUhRMFlhTUVYM3FGQkR5UTkxWmFVREhyZ1dMNTYwQmZmeGhZa3BpQ3FYbWEyTy1HdHNSdEE3UnBWdW45WmFyTm5jYVJjUng?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiS0FVX3lxTE5HUGhqbHpRd0poZ1FuY0NQNHVHYlc0S3Y4Rzh5ejJfWDFYbG5Ja1V6TnhFdEg3bUkzRVN6YnkxckVNVmc0UGczVjdWVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;AFP.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxPMGNjMTZNQk5yQlROM2lfWklzN1EtQmVvdEpKZFd3YU1jV1JwTW14Zk1rLUt4SEFRWDBpaHFYb0dvVWRRQlYzbkgxTWhGWENyZnplTWVRREQ0UThiMVNXY29DblRmV2JjUXF5M0xacXNUTDdoTVRpUDBuZzJhVnNGcFZ0U2ZtZDM5MklmYlJBcDQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE1aYXRfUDc3VnE0OXQtWUMyR3pMY0V2MFBQcXRVd0dSd0E5MW1ObFVyWVYxUnVCRkNFVXpLdklpRFdEOEpPb0hBNndMbjB1a2JPeF9ZUl9hbGgzSTQ3WG5wTV9qOGQyVEF4YkREY2pzbGVDLTFLakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Continent | Substack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt